# E-learning Course
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: E-learning — Lessons unlock in sequence, reusing CAP-E06's state-guard
# shape (a Lesson is only reachable once its predecessor is completed)
# Case 21 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: elearning-enrollment.menata

Course

Fields

- Title : Text
- Description : Rich Text
- Lessons : Table of (Lesson Title, Content, Sequence)

Constraints

- Title is required.

Permissions

Instructor

- Author

Student

- View

Views

- Course Form : Form
- Course Catalog : List
- Course Detail : Detail
